{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_decisions_0049_server_address_in_app_d49", "label": "D-49 Server address entered in the app, not baked into the build (\u0420\u0415\u0428\u0415\u041d\u041e, user 2026-10-26; amendment 2026-10-27); several servers at once \u2014 stage 6", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0049-server-address-in-app.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Moving the server to a new domain required a new build, and self-hosters could not connect from a TestFlight build; invitation links must point to the server to register on"}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0049_server_address_in_app_build_time_server_url", "label": "Problem: iOS server address set at build time (DS_SERVER_URL) \u2014 server move needs a new build, self-hosting impossible from TestFlight", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0049-server-address-in-app.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0049_server_address_in_app_server_field_on_login", "label": "\u00ab\u0421\u0435\u0440\u0432\u0435\u0440\u00bb field on sign-in/sign-up; address checked via GET /v1/health before login, stored with account on device; switching server = log out (unsent-changes warning) and log in elsewhere; current server visible in settings", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0049-server-address-in-app.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0049_server_address_in_app_links_carry_server", "label": "Share and invitation links carry the server address: link opens app/web with the server chosen, person logs in or signs up and immediately gets the shared item", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0049-server-address-in-app.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0049_server_address_in_app_multi_server_stage6", "label": "Future (stage 6): several servers/accounts at once like mail accounts \u2014 account switcher, each with own server, spaces and keys; server choice in web together with this", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0049-server-address-in-app.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0049_server_address_in_app_web_own_domain", "label": "Web keeps working with the server of its own domain (served by the server itself)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0049-server-address-in-app.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0049_server_address_in_app_universal_links_limit", "label": "Universal Links open the app only for domains in the build; links from a foreign server open in browser with \u00ab\u041e\u0442\u043a\u0440\u044b\u0442\u044c \u0432 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0438\u00bb (datascratch:// scheme with server address)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0049-server-address-in-app.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0049_server_address_in_app_https_only_check", "label": "Address check: https:// only (localhost for development); server name and version from /v1/health shown before password entry", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/decisions/0049-server-address-in-app.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_decisions_0049_server_address_in_app_server_learns_only_connection", "label": "Server learns only that the person connected; keys and password still never leave the device", "file_type": "rationale",